#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:5
#: 47e9a69f12014d2b8ccc1744e4f058c8
msgid "Adding a new Log Message"
msgstr "添加新的日志消息"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:7
#: 60336ef88cbe4cf7b8e22fb70cd895c7
msgid ""
":ref:`DataFlash Logs <common-logs>` are stored on the flight controller's "
"onboard dataflash memory and can be downloaded after a flight.  The logs "
"provide detailed information about each flight which can be important "
"especially when trying to :ref:`diagnose why something went wrong <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DataFlash 日志 <common-logs>` 存储在飞控的板载数据闪存中，可在飞行后下载。日志提供了每次飞行的详细信息，在尝试 "
":ref:`诊断出现问题的原因 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs>` 时尤为重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:12
#: e5b8ec6cc1174434be822caad39476a1
msgid "This page explains how to write a new dataflash log message."
msgstr "本页介绍如何编写新的数据闪存日志消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:14
#: 8a453b5340b94280bc7280cb4ae20cf7
msgid ""
"a guide to understanding the formats of data logger messages is `HERE "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/README.md>`__"
" and how the code for these messages is parsed and checked for inclusion in "
"the documentation is `HERE "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/logger_metadata/README.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"了解数据日志消息格式的指南请参阅 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/README.md>`__，代码如何解析这些消息并检查是否纳入文档请参阅"
" `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/logger_metadata/README.md>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:17
#: a751502362b54eaba7269af82fc7f3fb
msgid "The Easy Way"
msgstr "简便方法"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:19
#: 1132404ceeab4ce38f952631d99c3740
msgid ""
"Use `AP::logger().Write(...) "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/AP_Logger.h#L278>`__:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `AP::logger().Write(...) "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/AP_Logger.h#L278>`__："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:26
#: 81c5464b83514edbb13864e2c72ae755
msgid ""
"An example of the top function being used can be found in `Compass_learn.cpp"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Compass/Compass_learn.cpp#L99>`__:"
msgstr ""
"使用顶层函数的示例可在 `Compass_learn.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Compass/Compass_learn.cpp#L99>`__"
" 中找到："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:40
#: a5b4d38b8d4640e9a84e51e30b53ccc7
msgid ""
"the 1st argument is the message name.  This should be 4 characters or less "
"and be unique"
msgstr "第 1 个参数是消息名称。应为 4 个字符或更少且唯一"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:41
#: 19bb5cb1860046cf9b5f8c60da384353
msgid ""
"the 2nd argument is a comma separated list of up to 16 field names; with a "
"limit of 64 characters in total"
msgstr "第 2 个参数是最多 16 个字段名的逗号分隔列表；总长度限制为 64 个字符"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:42
#: 8c8e76321403418eb32c07036bfa1de9
msgid ""
"the 3rd argument is a format string (maximum of 16 characters) with each "
"letter holding the format for the corresponding field.  The meaning of each "
"letter can be found `here in AP_Logger/LogStructure.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L6>`__"
msgstr ""
"第 3 个参数是格式字符串（最多 16 个字符），每个字母表示对应字段的格式。每个字母的含义可在 `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h "
"中的此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L6>`__"
" 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:43
#: 3002588bfb1f4d84b22fbdd18d75fae1
msgid "the remaining arguments are the actual values that will be logged."
msgstr "其余参数是将被记录的实际值。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:45
#: 7ff8d899b9574a4d82c3c88a89bb90c2
msgid ""
"The 2nd Log_Write function is the same as the first except that it accepts "
"two additional string arguments, `\"units\" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__"
" and `\"mults\" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__."
" Similar to the \"format\" argument, each character in these arguments "
"specifies the `units "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__"
" (i.e. \"d\" for degrees) or `multiplier "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__"
" (i.e. \"2\" for \\*100, \"B\" for \\*0.01) for the following fields. These "
"help the graphing tools scale the output correctly when displaying to the "
"user."
msgstr ""
"第 2 个 Log_Write 函数与第 1 个相同，但额外接受两个字符串参数 `「units」 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__"
" 和 `「mults」 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__。与「format」参数类似，这些参数中的每个字符指定后续字段的"
" `单位 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__（如「d」表示度）或"
" `乘数 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__（如「2」表示"
" \\*100，「B」表示 \\*0.01）。这些帮助绘图工具在向用户显示时正确缩放输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:53
#: 4fb3382c909247f198294cb1481d8236
msgid ""
"For example, below is a \"TEST\" log message which outputs the current "
"system time and altitude."
msgstr "例如，下面是一个输出当前系统时间和高度的「TEST」日志消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:64
#: 2df49086c3af494c92b4a9562f414ec0
msgid ""
"the time has units of seconds (\"s\"), multiplier of \"F\" to indicate the "
"value should be divided by 1 million and format of \"Q\" to indicate it is "
"output as a 64 bit unsigned integer."
msgstr "时间的单位为秒（「s」），乘数为「F」表示该值应除以 100 万，格式为「Q」表示以 64 位无符号整数输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:65
#: 0e33ff36fafa4a808a2a025c9c47d391
msgid ""
"the altitude has units of meters (\"m\"), multiplier of \"B\" to indicate "
"the value should be divided by 100 (to convert from centimeters to meters) "
"and format of \"f\" because the value is a float."
msgstr "高度的单位为米（「m」），乘数为「B」表示该值应除以 100（将厘米转换为米），格式为「f」因为该值是浮点数。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:68
#: 2d07f4a754074dd3b5fe933446e9c6a0
msgid "The Harder Way"
msgstr "复杂方法"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:70
#: 43f4ab35105a43d49d5f0e529ede8f45
msgid ""
"For commonly used messages, especially those which are output at a "
"relatively high rate (50hz or more) a slightly more efficient logging method"
" can be used."
msgstr "对于常用消息，尤其是以较高频率（50Hz 或更高）输出的消息，可使用稍微更高效的日志记录方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:72
#: 981a476b451843e39bd2641275117830
msgid ""
"decide if the logging will come from a library (i.e. the call to Log_Write "
"will from somewhere within the `libraries directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__) or the "
"vehicle code (i.e. from within `ArduCopter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduCopter>`__, "
"`ArduPlane "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduPlane>`__, etc)"
msgstr ""
"决定日志记录是来自库（即 Log_Write 调用将来自 `libraries 目录 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries>`__ "
"中的某处）还是飞行器代码（即来自 `ArduCopter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduCopter>`__、`ArduPlane"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/ArduPlane>`__ 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:75
#: 7e39f71fd4454601977cf71d746c9a29
msgid ""
"add a new entry to the `vehicle's #define list or enum in defines.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/defines.h#L222>`__"
" or `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h's LogMessages enum "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L1566>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 `飞行器的 defines.h 中的 #define 列表或枚举 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/defines.h#L222>`__"
" 或 `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h 的 LogMessages 枚举 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L1566>`__"
" 中添加新条目。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:76
#: 59f60834a5dd4b03b97a8679867cb478
msgid ""
"define a structure to hold the values to be logged in either the vehicle's "
"`Log.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Log.cpp>`__ "
"file or in `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h>`__."
"  All log file messages should have time_us as their first field."
msgstr ""
"在飞行器的 `Log.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Log.cpp>`__ "
"文件或 `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h>`__"
" 中定义一个用于保存待记录值的结构体。所有日志文件消息的第一个字段应为 time_us。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:87
#: 12ccd57be8a747639f95116154508dc7
msgid ""
"add the log message's name, `units "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__,"
" `multiplier "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__"
" and `format "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L6>`__"
" strings into the `vehicle's LogStructure array "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Log.cpp#L454>`__"
" or `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h's LOG_EXTRA_STRUCTURES array "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L1360>`__"
msgstr ""
"将日志消息的名称、`单位 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L42>`__、`乘数"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L86>`__"
" 和 `格式 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L6>`__"
" 字符串添加到 `飞行器的 LogStructure 数组 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Log.cpp#L454>`__"
" 或 `AP_Logger/LogStructure.h 的 LOG_EXTRA_STRUCTURES 数组 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/LogStructure.h#L1360>`__"
" 中"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:89
#: b69fc4fb2bab4ad79f1a5e520a6c699e
msgid ""
"add a new method to the vehicle code or AP_Logger library called "
"Write_<something-or-other> which fills in the structure and then calls "
"`AP_Logger/WriteBlock() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/AP_Logger.h#L197>`__"
msgstr ""
"在飞行器代码或 AP_Logger 库中添加一个名为 Write_<something-or-other> 的新方法，该方法填充结构体然后调用 "
"`AP_Logger/WriteBlock() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Logger/AP_Logger.h#L197>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-a-new-log-message.rst:103
#: d086572136ab4d88881d6753041170ae
msgid ""
"call this new function from the :ref:`scheduler <code-overview-scheduling-"
"your-new-code-to-run-intermittently>` or from some other place in the code "
"at the moment you wish to log the values"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`调度器 <code-overview-scheduling-your-new-code-to-run-intermittently>` "
"中调用这个新函数，或在您希望记录值的时刻从代码中的其他位置调用"
